Package: DCC
Title: Analysis of Central Composite Designs
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Wanderley", "Xavier Pereira", 
           email = "wander.wx@gmail.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for generation and statistical analysis of Central Composite Designs (CCD). 
    The package allows experimental matrix generation, matrix export, model fitting, ANOVA, 
    estimation of effects and coefficients, response surface visualization, contour plots, 
    Pareto charts, consolidated analytical summaries and automated report export. Designed for 
    researchers, students and professionals working with experimental design and process optimization.
